## 3. Mandatory Audit & Overrides Specification

| Action | Workflow & Audit System Behavior |
|---|---|
| **Human Approval** | Creates record in `payment_allocations` linked to `repayment_schedules.id`, updates schedule balance and status, sets case status to `resolved`, logs action `APPROVE_ALLOCATION` in `audit_logs` with `user_id` and timestamp. |
| **Human Rejection** | Sets `ai_recommendations.status = 'rejected'`, updates case status to `rejected`, records rejection reason in `audit_logs`. Case remains fully auditable. |
| **Pending Investigation** | Unmatched or low-confidence cases (<70%) are assigned `reconciliation_cases.status = 'under_review'`. They remain active in the Accountant Action Center for manual search and matching. |
| **Accountant Override** | If accountant rejects AI suggestion and selects a different company/repayment, the system requires a mandatory `override_reason` text string. Backend records `{ old_ai_recommendation, manual_allocation, override_reason }` in `audit_logs` under action `OVERRIDE_RECONCILIATION`. |

